# Build context for scripts/docker/tests.Dockerfile: the repo with its tests, without local state.
# `**/` patterns, so the services' own venvs and caches stay out as well as the root's.
.git
.claude
**/.venv
**/.env*
!**/*.example
**/*.env
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.hypothesis
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/test-results
staticfiles
backups
postmatch_screens
scoreocr_out
research_notes
reports
Bebot-simpleDraft
# The deploy's local state: Ansible's venv and collections, the vault password and the real
# inventories (only the example is part of the repo's tests).
**/.vault-pass
deploy/ansible/collections
deploy/ansible/inventories/*
!deploy/ansible/inventories/example
